 ds_map_add(m,"It seems that everything is back to normal hehe I'm going to make some money with these drunkards","Parece que todo ha vuelto a la normalidad, jeje. Voy a sacarles algo de dinero a estos borrachos.");
 ds_map_add(m,"That... is... The most logical thing I've ever heard in my life thank you very much for the information <3!","Eso... es... lo más lógico que he oído en mi vida. ¡Muchísimas gracias por la información <3!");
 ds_map_add(m,"*whispering* What a stupid thing to do.","*En voz baja* Qué estupidez.");
 ds_map_add(m,"MMmm if you want to be pure like a rabbit bring your hands to your head and move them like a bunny <3 oh and don't forget to say pyon pyon.","MMmm, si quieres ser pura como un conejo, pon las manos sobre la cabeza y muévelas como si fueras un conejito <3. Ah, y no olvides decir «pyon pyon».");
 ds_map_add(m,"If you have anything you can help me with please let me know!","¡Si hay algo en lo que pueda ayudarte, dímelo!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmm looking for the purity of a rabbit and how to replicate it?","Mmm, ¿buscas la pureza de un conejo y cómo imitarla?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey I hope my advice is helping you <3","¡Espero que mis consejos te estén ayudando <3!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do me the favor of saying no if she talks to you about those things, she is my best friend but I wouldn't like her to come between us.","Hazme el favor de decirle que no si te habla de esas cosas. Es mi mejor amiga, pero no quiero que se interponga entre nosotras.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh I almost forgot Ms honney, she sometimes looks for people who want somewhat different experiences.","Ah, casi se me olvida: la señora Honney a veces busca gente dispuesta a probar experiencias algo diferentes.");
 ds_map_add(m,"She will be there don't worry Callie.","Estará allí, no te preocupes, Callie.");
 ds_map_add(m,"So I could introduce you to my children in a more appropriate way than now haha.","Así podría presentarte a mis hijos de una forma más apropiada que esta, jaja.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Haha I would also like you to come to my house for lunch.","Jaja, también me gustaría que vinieras a mi casa a comer.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I love that you liked it.","Me encanta que te haya gustado.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well, hehe that was  awesome.","Bueno, jeje, ha estado genial.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Come, join us for lunch.","Ven, acompáñanos a comer.");
 ds_map_add(m,"You will love it, it is cheap, tasty and fast <3 .","Te encantará: es barato, rico y rápido <3.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh sure, I've never eaten that kind of food before but it looks delicious.","Ah, claro. Nunca había probado este tipo de comida, pero tiene una pinta deliciosa.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line! You arrived, did you see the feast I have prepared?","¡Line! Ya llegaste. ¿Has visto el festín que he preparado?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh give me a second Honey, I'm doing the dishes.","Espera un segundo, Honey, estoy fregando los platos.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thank you, to get to the library just follow this road to the west of town.","Gracias. Para llegar a la biblioteca, sigue este camino hacia el oeste del pueblo.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmmm I will see if I can find out anything, do not worry, you can go back to reading your favorite books.","Mmmm, veré si puedo averiguar algo. No te preocupes, puedes volver a leer tus libros favoritos.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I don't know, the librarian is missing so the library is closed.","No lo sé. La bibliotecaria ha desaparecido, así que la biblioteca está cerrada.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh, why what happened?","Vaya, ¿por qué? ¿Qué ha pasado?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Aw man, I wanted to go to the library.","Jo, quería ir a la biblioteca.");
 ds_map_add(m,"You find anything yet?","¿Has encontrado algo ya?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmmmm, oHhh, Ah ha wooooow.\nI forgot I can't read.","Mmmmm, oHhh, Ah, ja, guau.\nSe me había olvidado que no sé leer.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I will have to show you what I want to save you from","Tendré que enseñarte de qué intento protegerte");
 ds_map_add(m,"if you're going to trust that demon","si vas a confiar en ese demonio");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm really sorry ava, I believe lili","Lo siento mucho, Ava. Le creo a Lili.");
 ds_map_add(m,"please line you have to believe me, I am part of you, if I say that something horrible will happen to you, it will happen to me anyway, stop it before it's too late","Por favor, Line, tienes que creerme. Soy parte de ti. Si digo que te ocurrirá algo horrible, también me ocurrirá a mí. Detén esto antes de que sea demasiado tarde.");
 ds_map_add(m,"calm Line let me continue with this and everything will be solved","Tranquila, Line. Déjame seguir con esto y todo se resolverá.");
 ds_map_add(m,"but why ava, what have i done to you i thought we were best friends","Pero ¿por qué, Ava? ¿Qué te he hecho? Creía que éramos mejores amigas.");
 ds_map_add(m,"you do not talk to me like that, you are a mistake of nature you caused all this and I will try to fix it","No me hables así. Eres un error de la naturaleza. Tú causaste todo esto y yo intentaré arreglarlo.");
 ds_map_add(m,"don't believe this crazy bitch she she tries to murder you and your mother","No le creas a esta zorra loca. ¡Intenta matarte a ti y a tu madre!");
 ds_map_add(m,"don't worry Line everything will be fine you don't need to do anything","No te preocupes, Line. Todo saldrá bien; no tienes que hacer nada.");
 ds_map_add(m,"What's wrong with you, why do you escape from me?","¿Qué te pasa? ¿Por qué huyes de mí?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line, I do this for you please understand me","Line, hago esto por ti. Por favor, entiéndeme.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ava please stop","Ava, por favor, basta.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm sorry but I haven't seen her around here.","Lo siento, pero no la he visto por aquí.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh okay, I wanted to ask, you have seen a woman with wings in her head around here?","Ah, vale. Quería preguntarte si has visto por aquí a una mujer con alas en la cabeza.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Unfortunately we ran out of alcohol a little while ago.","Por desgracia, nos quedamos sin alcohol hace un rato.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Welcome to the bar fluid sky.","Bienvenida al bar Cielo Líquido.");
 ds_map_add(m,"This broom has been here for a long time, I don't think they will come looking for it, it will help you travel faster through the town <3.","Esta escoba lleva aquí muchísimo tiempo; no creo que nadie venga a reclamarla. Te ayudará a moverte más rápido por el pueblo <3.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well the truth haha I have nothing here but I had thought to give you something from the lost & found box.","Bueno, la verdad, jaja, no tengo nada aquí, pero había pensado regalarte algo de la caja de objetos perdidos.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thank you very much beating that demon was quite an odyssey but gestures like these make it worth it <3.","Muchísimas gracias. Derrotar a ese demonio fue toda una odisea, pero gestos como este hacen que haya valido la pena <3.");
 ds_map_add(m,"*covers Line's mouth and murmurs* shut-up.","*Le tapa la boca a Line y murmura* Cállate.");
