 ds_map_add(m,"AHHHH! THIS IS HOW YOU REPAY ME AFTER DEFENDING YOU FROM ALL THOSE WHO SAID YOU WERE A ROTTEN FAIRY. COME ON LET'S FIGHT HERE NOW!","¡AAAAH! ¡ASÍ ME PAGAS DESPUÉS DE DEFENDERTE DE TODOS LOS QUE DECIAN QUE ERAS UN HADA ASQUEROSA! ¡VAMOS, PELEEMOS AQUÍ MISMO!");
 ds_map_add(m,"You know I've seen you and you're no wonder at sex, I'd even say you're bad at it, the only thing that satisfies people is that you're half succubus!","Ya te he visto y no eres ninguna maravilla en la cama; hasta diría que eres mala. ¡Lo único que satisface a la gente es que eres medio súcubo!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili stop joking you do not stand a chance.","Lili, deja de bromear. No tienes ninguna posibilidad.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ahhh stop victimizing yourself, you know if you think you're so good at this let's compete!","¡Ahhh, deja de hacerte la víctima! Si crees que eres tan buena en esto, ¡compitamos!");
 ds_map_add(m,"... Looks like you finally show your true colors. You only did all this so that one day you could say it to my face.","... Parece que por fin muestras tu verdadera cara. Solo hiciste todo esto para poder echármelo en cara algún día.");
 ds_map_add(m,"AHHHH stop being so condescending first I want to do all these things but with someone I love not complete strangers like you fucking bitch!","¡AAAAH, deja de tratarme con tanta superioridad! Quiero hacer todas esas cosas, sí, ¡pero con alguien a quien ame, no con completos desconocidos como tú, maldita zorra!");
 ds_map_add(m,"It's okay Lili we know that fairies are born from the flower and there is no need to use their reproductive organs you have nothing to explain <3.","No pasa nada, Lili. Sabemos que las hadas nacen de las flores y no necesitan usar sus órganos reproductores. No tienes que explicar nada <3.");
 ds_map_add(m,"... Hey just because I don't do it as an addict like you doesn't mean I'm not interested in this world.","... Oye, que no lo haga como una adicta como tú no significa que no me interese este mundo.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh no thank you very much Lili doesn't like this kind of thing she's kind of boring and moody but anyway thanks again <3.","Oh, no, muchas gracias. A Lili no le gustan estas cosas; es un poco aburrida y tiene mal genio. Pero, de todos modos, gracias otra vez <3.");
 ds_map_add(m,"... I think it's like a tranze or something, it just doesn't answer our questions.","... Creo que está como en trance o algo así; simplemente no responde a nuestras preguntas.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you want to participate to find out who is the best Onahole?","¿Quieres participar para descubrir quién es la mejor muñeca sexual?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Forgive her please, she has no filters when she speaks :c.","Perdónala, por favor. No tiene ningún filtro cuando habla :c.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ahhh Lili shut up already! I mean she might be sick from the swamp.","¡Ahhh, Lili, cállate de una vez! Quiero decir, puede que haya enfermado por culpa del pantano.");
 ds_map_add(m,"And that does not include us, we were born with this hair color.","Y eso no nos incluye a nosotras; nacimos con este color de pelo.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yeah, she is crazy.","Sí, está loca.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Relax Lili she is probably his sister, she looks just like the bartender although she has short red hair, you know what that means.","Tranquila, Lili. Seguramente sea su hermana; se parece muchísimo a la camarera, aunque tiene el pelo rojo y corto. Ya sabes lo que significa.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey but you didn't answer my question!","¡Oye, pero todavía no has respondido a mi pregunta!");
 ds_map_add(m,"This place is for VIP clients where they can compete to see what can satisfy the needs of our other clients.","Este lugar es para clientes VIP. Aquí pueden competir para ver quién satisface mejor las necesidades de los demás clientes.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, are you the bartender's sister?","Oye, ¿eres la hermana del camarero?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Welcome to the 1 V 1 for the GLORY! hole.","¡Bienvenida al agujero 1 contra 1 por la GLORIA!");
 ds_map_add(m,"The competition to find out who is the best onahole is for VIP customers only.","La competición para descubrir quién es la mejor muñeca sexual es solo para clientes VIP.");
 ds_map_add(m,"No thanks, we're just passing by.","No, gracias. Solo estamos de paso.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Welcome, are you coming back to compete?","Bienvenido. ¿Has vuelto para competir?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Haha you're welcome, whatever else you need come see me. (but if you need a foot massage or something, I'm here pretty)","Jaja, de nada. Si necesitas cualquier otra cosa, ven a verme. (Aunque, si quieres un masaje de pies o algo así, aquí estoy, guapo).");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thank you so much that helps me a lot, I've been after her trail all day and my feet are killing me.","Muchísimas gracias, me has ayudado un montón. Llevo todo el día siguiendo su rastro y me duelen muchísimo los pies.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Most likely she is in the town, you just have to go through the tunnel.","Lo más probable es que esté en el pueblo; solo tienes que atravesar el túnel.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I think I've seen someone like that but I don't know if it's really the same person.","Creo que he visto a alguien así, pero no sé si era realmente la misma persona.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm looking for someone, a woman in a black dress.","Estoy buscando a alguien: una mujer con un vestido negro.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes of course? (wow, she's very pretty)","¿Sí, claro? (Vaya, es muy guapa).");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hi can i ask you a question?","Hola, ¿puedo hacerte una pregunta?");
