 ds_map_add(m,"You wanted to get into this mess, also I think he is right, even if you are a succubus or you faint or you are the first to finish.","Tú te metiste en este lío. Además, creo que tiene razón: aunque seas una súcubo, o te desmayas o eres la primera en terminar.");
 ds_map_add(m,"WHAT, but here and now ?!","¡¿QUÉ?! ¿Pero aquí y ahora?");
 ds_map_add(m,"You will have a session five positions and in each one I will finish which you must transform the semen into energy.","Tendrás una sesión de cinco posturas y, en cada una, yo terminaré. Tú tendrás que transformar el semen en energía.");
 ds_map_add(m,"We are gonna have sex of course <3","Vamos a tener sexo, por supuesto <3.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh okay then what are we gonna do Big sis?","Oh, vale. Entonces, ¿qué vamos a hacer, hermanita mayor?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Please call me Big sis.","Por favor, llámame hermanita mayor.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thanks sakura hehe. <3","Gracias, Sakura, jeje. <3");
 ds_map_add(m,"I mean your stamina haha, don't worry line you are beautiful just the way you are. <3","Me refiero a tu resistencia, jaja. No te preocupes, Line, eres preciosa tal como eres. <3");
 ds_map_add(m,"hey watch your mauth! Line is not chubby, she is full of love","¡Eh, vigila esa boca! Line no está rellenita, está llena de amor.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I know, that you I gained a little weight :c","Lo sé, he ganado un poquito de peso :c.");
 ds_map_add(m,"But first of all you have a horrible physical condition right now you are panting","Pero, antes que nada, ahora mismo estás en una condición física horrible. Estás jadeando.");
 ds_map_add(m,"It was great <3! Although your succubus skills are not the best, your elf side makes up for what you lack.","¡Ha sido genial <3! Aunque tus habilidades de súcubo no sean las mejores, tu lado elfo compensa lo que te falta.");
 ds_map_add(m,"* gasping * so- so what do you think sakura.","*Jadeando* E-entonces, ¿qué te parece, Sakura?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Sakura the succubus Queen of another world","Sakura, la reina súcubo de otro mundo");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hehe, it sounds good, I'll see you there <3","Jeje, suena bien. Nos vemos allí <3.");
 ds_map_add(m,"We live in an abandoned storage, warehouse or something like that, you can stay but you have to get yourself a job we don't even have to buy food for ourselves.","Vivimos en un almacén abandonado, o algo así. Puedes quedarte, pero tendrás que conseguir trabajo. Ni siquiera tenemos dinero para comprar comida.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I guess it's okay where can I find you again?","Supongo que está bien. ¿Dónde puedo encontrarte otra vez?");
 ds_map_add(m,"let her rest, it's the first time she lasted so long.","Déjala descansar. Es la primera vez que aguanta tanto.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey but cute the training is not over yet.","¡Eh, pero qué mona! El entrenamiento todavía no ha terminado.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Uff that was  great and really  exausting.","Uf, ha sido genial y agotador de verdad.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Don't worry I'll give you the best death an elf can have.","No te preocupes, te daré la mejor muerte que puede tener una elfa.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wa-wait! you are forgetting about me.","¡E-espera! Te estás olvidando de mí.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I don't wanna die, this is your fault!","¡No quiero morir! ¡Esto es culpa tuya!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hu-Hu a little pink snack.","Je, je... un pequeño tentempié rosado.");
 ds_map_add(m,"*whispering* It's perfect Line, she doesn't know you're a succubus drain her until she falls asleep and we'll win.","*Susurrando* Es perfecto, Line. No sabe que eres una súcubo. Drena su energía hasta que se duerma y ganaremos.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Dont worry, you'll live as long as you keep satisfying me <3.","No te preocupes, seguirás viva mientras sigas satisfaciéndome <3.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line you will never beat her in a fight.","Line, nunca podrás vencerla en una pelea.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Dagnabbit is to strong!","¡Maldita sea, es demasiado fuerte!");
 ds_map_add(m,"By the way I am half succubus and it helps me to fight differently don't think anything strange. :c","Por cierto, soy mitad súcubo y eso me permite luchar de otra manera. No pienses cosas raras. :c");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'll keep it in a safe place where it won't make any trouble.","Lo guardaré en un lugar seguro donde no cause problemas.");
 ds_map_add(m,"All right, but don't kill the demon, we have questions for her.","De acuerdo, pero no mates al demonio. Tenemos preguntas que hacerle.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well everything it turn ok plus you help me with this problem I will make the guards find this friends of yours.","Bueno, si todo sale bien y además me ayudas con este problema, haré que los guardias encuentren a esos amigos tuyos.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Cof cof... returning to the topic.","Cof, cof... volviendo al tema.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Great, you are just another pervert.","Genial, eres otra pervertida más.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I was waiting for the right moment to attack when your friend ... you know, I lost concentration..","Estaba esperando el momento adecuado para atacar, pero cuando tu amiga... ya sabes, perdí la concentración...");
 ds_map_add(m,"What?! You stared us, while we almost die!","¡¿Qué?! ¡Nos estuviste mirando mientras casi moríamos!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wha-what? you saw me do-doing those sthings.","¿Q-qué? ¿Me viste ha-haciendo esas cosas?");
 ds_map_add(m,"I must say it's a peculiar way of fighting.","Debo decir que es una forma peculiar de luchar.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I know, I've been watching all this time.","Lo sé, he estado observando todo este tiempo.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yeah and don't play the victim, we beat the demon!","Sí, y no te hagas la víctima. ¡Derrotamos al demonio!");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am sorry we came to know if she had information about our friend.","Lo siento. Vinimos para averiguar si ella tenía información sobre nuestra amiga.");
 ds_map_add(m,"So you are the adventurer giving false orders to my guards?.","Entonces, ¿tú eres la aventurera que está dando órdenes falsas a mis guardias?");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am also perfect baby.","Yo también soy perfecta, cariño.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Fuck no, she said that I was a corrupt fairy because I seem to curse a lot.","¡Ni hablar! Dijo que era un hada corrupta porque parece que digo muchas palabrotas.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Won't you pray to the goddess of fairies?","¿No vas a rezarle a la diosa de las hadas?");
 ds_map_add(m,"* praying * oh incubus god and elf goddess I beg you to bless us so that everything goes well for us.","*Rezando* Oh, dios íncubo y diosa elfa, os ruego que nos bendigáis para que todo nos salga bien.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili what is happening to you? You are not like that, well I will take them but not for your reasons if not because he asked them.","Lili, ¿qué te pasa? Tú no eres así. Bueno, me los llevaré, pero no por tus motivos, sino porque él me los pidió.");
 ds_map_add(m,"You know forget it if it kills us it will be your fault but let's take all the wines we can, maybe it won't kill us that way.","Sabes qué, olvídalo. Si nos mata, será culpa tuya. Pero llevémonos todo el vino que podamos; quizá así no nos mate.");
 ds_map_add(m,"But didn't you see how he yell at you before ?!","¡¿Pero no viste cómo te gritó antes?!");
 ds_map_add(m,"* surprise * Oh, Lili .. did you just judge someone without even knowing him?","*Sorprendida* Oh, Lili... ¿acabas de juzgar a alguien sin siquiera conocerlo?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Damn Line! look at his appearance the guy could not look more dangerous.","¡Maldita sea, Line! Mira su aspecto. Ese tipo no podría parecer más peligroso.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well, we are here, and if it was so dangerous, why not, did he attack us before?","Bueno, ya estamos aquí. Y si fuera tan peligroso, ¿por qué no nos atacó antes?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line I think he apologizes for us to do what he needs and not because he really is sorry.","Line, creo que se disculpa para conseguir que hagamos lo que necesita, no porque de verdad lo sienta.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Nooo! He needs help also, you saw how I did apologize and if a person manages to apologize I don't think it's as bad as you say.","¡Nooo! ¡También necesita ayuda! Viste cómo me disculpé yo, y si alguien es capaz de disculparse, no creo que sea tan malo como dices.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line I know that you are a little naive for this world but I think it would be better not to go back to that guy.","Line, sé que eres un poco ingenua para este mundo, pero creo que sería mejor no volver con ese tipo.");
 ds_map_add(m,"We got it  lili <3!.","¡Lo conseguimos, Lili <3!");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm sorry but we can't, someone else needs this crystal to return home","Lo siento, pero no podemos. Otra persona necesita este cristal para volver a casa.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Why is it that every time I find a crystal, you are in the middle?","¿Por qué cada vez que encuentro un cristal, tú estás metida en medio?");
 ds_map_add(m,"This Crystal belongs to the Red Team.","Este cristal pertenece al Equipo Rojo.");
 ds_map_add(m,"No Lili, that poor man needs our help, if not, he will never return to his dimension","No, Lili. Ese pobre hombre necesita nuestra ayuda; de lo contrario, nunca podrá regresar a su dimensión.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line let her take it and let's go on our way","Line, deja que se lo lleve y sigamos nuestro camino.");
 ds_map_add(m,"DEV: Sorry dude, the gallery is only for the full game you will have to put away that dingledong.","DEV: Lo siento, colega, la galería es solo para la versión completa. Tendrás que guardar ese pichulín.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Saving the game do not turn off the console...","Al guardar la partida, no apagues la consola...");
 ds_map_add(m,"Gallery.","Galería.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do you want to sleep and save the game?","¿Quieres dormir y guardar la partida?");
 ds_map_add(m,"I know that is why I want to give you this, my friend Laura loves it.","Lo sé, por eso quiero darte esto. A mi amiga Laura le encanta.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh theres no problem I did it because I wanted to be close to you, i gues hehe.","Oh, no pasa nada. Lo hice porque quería estar cerca de ti, supongo, jeje.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line, I wanted to thank you for helping me catch that criminal.","Line, quería darte las gracias por ayudarme a atrapar a ese criminal.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I could not agree more haha.","No podría estar más de acuerdo, jaja.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I must say it was a pleasure to be so close to her <3.","Debo decir que fue un placer estar tan cerca de ella <3.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh look what she gave me before he left, it's an autographed photo of her and 30 buppy bucks if we go to tricotex someday.","Oh, mira lo que me dio antes de irse: una foto suya autografiada y 30 Buppy Bucks si algún día vamos a Tricotex.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Dont worry about me Lili, I do not think saying goodbye was necessary <3.","No te preocupes por mí, Lili. No creo que hiciera falta despedirse <3.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh Line you fell asleep, and you couldn't you said goodbye to Sam.","Oh, Line, te has quedado dormida y no has podido despedirte de Sam.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line realizes that she is in her bed and understands that Sam left her there.","Line se da cuenta de que está en su cama y comprende que Sam la dejó allí.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili wakes up Line.","Lili despierta a Line.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Give me everything you got!","¡Dame todo lo que tengas!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ca-calm Line I... I.. I can not contain myself anymore.","Ca-calma, Line. Yo... yo... ya no puedo contenerme.");
 ds_map_add(m,"The fruit made you gro-grow a really big penis.","La fruta hizo que te cre-creciera un pene enorme.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I would not know how to do it, please help me, I can no longer contain myself.","No sé cómo hacerlo. Por favor, ayúdame, ya no puedo contenerme.");
