 ds_map_add(m,"But Lili, that is for a succubus who really needs it!","¡Pero, Lili, eso es para una súcubo que realmente lo necesita!");
 ds_map_add(m,"I get paid to refill the jars and give it to a succubus, as long as I do that it will be fine.","Me pagan por rellenar los frascos y entregárselos a una súcubo. Mientras haga eso, todo irá bien.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmmm... if I help you, would you give the jar to my friend?","Mmmm... si te ayudo, ¿le darás el frasco a mi amiga?");
 ds_map_add(m,"I'm sorry I've been here so long, now it's hard for me to get excited, Guau! I need something new.","Lo siento, llevo tanto tiempo aquí que ya me cuesta excitarme. ¡Guau! Necesito algo nuevo.");
 ds_map_add(m,"The bad thing is that our little friend doesn't want to cooperate.","Lo malo es que nuestra pequeña amiga no quiere cooperar.");
 ds_map_add(m,"They are for succubus who live an 'alternative' way of life, which helps them to control themselves.","Son para las súcubos que llevan un estilo de vida «alternativo», lo que las ayuda a controlarse.");
 ds_map_add(m,"AGHHH, that fucking disgusting why do you do that?!","¡AGHHH, qué asco de mierda! ¿¡Por qué haces eso!?");
 ds_map_add(m,"We refill the jars with leftover semen that falls on the floor.","Rellenamos los frascos con el semen sobrante que cae al suelo.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili! forgive her she has, problems, but ... hehe why are you looking at an empty jar?","¡Lili! Perdónala, tiene sus problemillas, pero... jeje, ¿por qué estás mirando un frasco vacío?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Why are they looking at an empty jar, are they stupid?","¿Por qué miran un frasco vacío? ¿Son tontas?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Their burgers are excellent and the waitresses always tell me I'm a good guy Guau!","Sus hamburguesas son excelentes y las camareras siempre me dicen que soy un buen chico. ¡Guau!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Uff very viscous it looks like someone has been to smooshers many times <3.","Uf, qué viscoso. Parece que alguien ha ido muchas veces a Smooshers. <3");
 ds_map_add(m,"... you can take the jar with you, it's full to the brim.","... Puedes llevarte el frasco. Está lleno hasta el borde.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Stop eating junk food, that semen doesn't look healthy.","Deja de comer comida basura. Ese semen no parece muy saludable.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Euughh yuck!","¡Puaj, qué asco!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ohhh yes! It was better than running with a branch in my mouth Ruuff!","¡Ohhh, sí! ¡Ha sido mejor que correr con una rama en la boca! ¡Grruf!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wow seriously Lili? I can't wait to see it <3.","Vaya, ¿en serio, Lili? ¡Estoy deseando verlo! <3");
 ds_map_add(m,"I need to talk to Ms honney, I have to make some preparations for my mini show in this circus.","Tengo que hablar con la señorita MsHonney. Debo preparar algunas cosas para mi pequeño espectáculo en este circo.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh thanks <3, now what?","Oh, gracias. <3 ¿Y ahora qué?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Of course if line <3 and I see that you have improved in combat.","Claro que sí, Line. <3 Y veo que has mejorado en combate.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well did you get what you wanted?","Bueno, ¿has conseguido lo que querías?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Prepare your camera I'll do it right now, wait me near the center of the circus.","Prepara la cámara. Lo haré ahora mismo. Espérame cerca del centro del circo.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Word contracts also work, here you have just point and shoot.","Los contratos verbales también sirven. Aquí tienes: solo apunta y dispara.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Okay, but I must tell you that she and I do not have a contract as such, she asked me to push her to do lewd acts because she is afraid to take the initiative.","Vale, pero debo decirte que ella y yo no tenemos un contrato como tal. Me pidió que la empujara a hacer cosas obscenas porque le da miedo tomar la iniciativa.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Let's make a deal, I'll give you the laser beam and in exchange you let me record her first hypnosis.","Hagamos un trato: te daré el rayo láser y, a cambio, me dejarás grabar su primera sesión de hipnosis.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wow that elf even gets naked when she fights.","Vaya, esa elfa hasta se desnuda cuando pelea.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ok for my magic trick I need you Line really steal and say, haigure!","Vale, para mi truco de magia necesito que te quedes quieta, Line, y que digas: ¡haigure!");
 ds_map_add(m,"After understanding Lili's plan, Mshonney takes everyone in the circus to the center.","Después de entender el plan de Lili, Mshonney reúne a todos los del circo en el centro.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili tells Mshonney everything behind Line's back.","Lili se lo cuenta todo a Mshonney a espaldas de Line.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line! come here is show time.","¡Line! ¡Ven aquí, que empieza el espectáculo!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well, if she's not my slave why does she fight for me?","Bueno, si no es mi esclava, ¿por qué lucha por mí?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Sorry, I don't believe you, that elf response you a lot to be your slave.","Lo siento, no te creo. Esa elfa te lleva demasiado la contraria como para ser tu esclava.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Shit that's great, how much does it cost?","Mierda, qué maravilla. ¿Cuánto cuesta?");
 ds_map_add(m,"I am selling a hypnotic lazer that also changes clothes, but only to people who have a master-slave contract.","Vendo un láser hipnótico que también cambia la ropa, pero solo a personas que tengan un contrato de amo y esclavo.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Now, tell me what you sell.","Ahora dime qué vendes tú.");
 ds_map_add(m,"ok...","Vale...");
 ds_map_add(m,"Just do it, it will be great for you, trust me..","Hazlo y ya está. Te encantará, créeme...");
 ds_map_add(m,"bu-but why?","Pe-pero ¿por qué?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line sit on that chair now!","¡Line, siéntate en esa silla ahora mismo!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Wha-what?!","¿Q-qué?!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Come for the laser beam, who is the dominant?","¿Vienes por el rayo láser? ¿Quién es el dominante?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Sure whatever.","Claro, lo que sea.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh my god Lili, you are incorrigible! I do not know if I can forgive you.","¡Dios mío, Lili, no tienes remedio! No sé si podré perdonarte.");
 ds_map_add(m,"*whispering* of course that I like it, just play along, I do not want pleople to know that I am like this.","*En voz baja* Claro que me gusta. Sígueme el juego; no quiero que la gente sepa que soy así.");
 ds_map_add(m,"You saying it like you didn't like itt, you Little bitch <3.","Lo dices como si no te hubiera gustado, pequeña zorra. <3");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili that was so humiliating, everyone was looking at me and I was all wet, what's wrong with you! and what is haigure ?!","¡Lili, ha sido humillante! Todo el mundo me estaba mirando y estaba empapada. ¡¿Qué te pasa?! ¡Y qué demonios significa «haigure»?!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do not worry, life rewards those who work hard <3","Sí, la vida recompensa a quienes se esfuerzan. <3");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes the pay is not very good, since I get paid according to what people throw at me and well I'm not the best clown...","Sí, no pagan muy bien, porque me pagan según lo que la gente me lanza. Y bueno, no soy el mejor payaso...");
 ds_map_add(m,"At least you got an honorable job <3","Al menos tienes un trabajo honrado. <3");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, that's what I'm trying to do. this is the third ball I've broken. my claws don't help much.","Sí, eso intento. Ya he roto tres pelotas. Mis garras no ayudan mucho.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Cuervo, are you working as a clown in the circus?","Cuervo, ¿trabajas como payaso en el circo?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ahhh! I'm not very good at this but I must keep trying.","¡Ahhh! No se me da muy bien, pero tengo que seguir intentándolo.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I-I really trust you won't tell anyone, my hero.","De verdad confío en que no se lo contarás a nadie, héroe mío.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Haha you're absolutely right, when did that happen? Haha..ha.","Jaja, tienes toda la razón. ¿Cuándo pasó eso? Jaja... ja.");
 ds_map_add(m,"What, what money I do not understand when I gave money to you?","¿Qué? ¿Qué dinero? No entiendo. ¿Cuándo te di dinero?");
 ds_map_add(m,"So please do me a favor and don't tell anyone.","Así que, por favor, hazme el favor de no contárselo a nadie.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Doing it with you I think it was the right choice, plus I know you are good and the money made the kids and my sisters very happy... since I am not very good at being a clown...","Creo que hacerlo contigo fue la decisión correcta. Además, sé que eres buena persona y ese dinero hizo muy felices a los niños y a mis hermanas... porque no se me da muy bien ser payaso...");
 ds_map_add(m,"Don't tell Red how I got it I think she would be sad if she knew.","No le digas a Red cómo lo conseguí. Creo que se pondría triste si se enterara.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh, Line about the money.","Ah, Line, sobre el dinero...");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh so-sorry sorry.","Oh, lo-lo siento, perdón.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey don't get in the line!","¡Eh, no te cueles!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Four corner","Cuatro esquinas");
 ds_map_add(m,"In four corners you will find everything to pass the time, they restore Night club and if something goes wrong everything is close to the hospital..","En Cuatro Esquinas encontrarás de todo para pasar el rato: restaurantes, discotecas y más. Y si algo sale mal, el hospital está muy cerca.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hmm ... okay but don't be as loud as usual, okay Solstice?","Mmm... vale, pero no hagas tanto ruido como de costumbre, ¿de acuerdo, Solstice?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yeah I'm pretty sure it'll be there in the southwest of the silent forest like always.","Sí, estoy casi segura de que estará allí, al suroeste del Bosque Silencioso, como siempre.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Again, do you think he will be there?","Otra vez, ¿crees que estará allí?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Are we going to watch the secret show tonight, right?","Esta noche iremos a ver el espectáculo secreto, ¿verdad?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmm what happend?","Mmm, ¿qué ha pasado?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey Equinox.","Hola, Equinox.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey!","¡Hola!");
 ds_map_add(m,"What you don't like being with your awesome sister?","¿Qué pasa? ¿No te gusta estar con tu increíble hermana?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yes, but I would have liked to be with a boyfriend or girlfriend instead of my sister.","Sí, pero preferiría estar con un novio o una novia en vez de con mi hermana.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I love this vacation <3.","Me encantan estas vacaciones. <3");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thank you very much I will be waiting for you on the second floor of the hotel when I find it <3.","Muchísimas gracias. Te esperaré en la segunda planta del hotel cuando la encuentre. <3");
 ds_map_add(m,"I wi-will look for your friend right now .. mommy.","B-buscaré a tu amiga ahora mismo... mami.");
 ds_map_add(m,"And it is the duty of a mother to take care of the problems of her pretty daughter.","Y es deber de una madre cuidar de los problemas de su preciosa hija.");
 ds_map_add(m,"How about a role play one that crosses the line, I can see that you are such a good and sweet girl but in reality you are a complete pervert and mommy cannot have a daughter who is constantly in heat.","¿Qué tal un juego de rol que cruce los límites? Veo que eres una chica buena y dulce, pero en realidad eres una pervertida total, y mamá no puede tener una hija que esté siempre cachonda.");
 ds_map_add(m,"What-what kind of pri-prize.","¿Q-qué tipo de pre-premio?");
 ds_map_add(m,"You are such a good girl, if you find her take her to the second floor of the hotel I could even give you a prize.","Eres una chica muy buena. Si la encuentras y la llevas a la segunda planta del hotel, incluso podría darte un premio.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh that is bad I will help you, I know what it feels like to be perpetually hot and can't get rid of it.","Oh, qué mal. Te ayudaré; sé lo que se siente al estar cachonda constantemente y no poder quitártelo de encima.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Although we are separated we feel the same, it seems that right now she is with someone having sex, it has been very difficult for me every day, I always feel so hot because of her.","Aunque estemos separadas, sentimos lo mismo. Parece que ahora mismo ella está teniendo sexo con alguien, y cada día me resulta muy difícil. Siempre estoy tan caliente por su culpa.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I have a problem I divided myself to have a good time, with different people in different places and well my other part seems to not want to return.","Tengo un problema. Me dividí para divertirme con distintas personas en distintos lugares, pero parece que mi otra parte no quiere regresar.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili do not be mean!","¡Lili, no seas mala!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, we're busy, what do you want ?!","¡Eh, estamos ocupadas! ¿Qué quieres?!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh.. well I do not really know if I be-beat her at all.","Oh... bueno, ni siquiera sé si de verdad la he-he vencido.");
 ds_map_add(m,"You are the traveler who defeated the demond at the entrance of the city, right? some guards were talking about a traveler with blue hair and a single horn that's why I recognized you <3.","Eres la viajera que derrotó al demonio en la entrada de la ciudad, ¿verdad? Unos guardias hablaban de una viajera de pelo azul y un solo cuerno. Por eso te reconocí. <3");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey, you the one with blue hair!","¡Eh, tú, la del pelo azul!");
 ds_map_add(m,"It does not appear to be in operation there is a mess inside.","Parece que está cerrado. Hay un desastre ahí dentro.");
 ds_map_add(m,"What am I doing, hehe, the club is closed during the day.","¿Qué hago aquí? Jeje, el club está cerrado durante el día.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Mmmm it's closed but I hear music coming from inside.","Mmmm, está cerrado, pero oigo música desde dentro.");
 ds_map_add(m,"What? but I just wanted to help. :c","¿Qué? ¡Pero si solo quería ayudar! :c");
 ds_map_add(m,"you're death!","¡Estás muerta!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Maybe even stronger than you! And your hair is horrible just look at you. ( Hehe I burn this bicth) ","¡Puede que incluso sea más fuerte que tú! Y tu pelo es horrible, mírate. (Jeje, le he dado donde más le duele a esta zorra).");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey what's wrong with you! Line although it does not seem is quite strong.","¡Eh, ¿qué te pasa?! Aunque no lo parezca, Line es bastante fuerte.");
 ds_map_add(m,"We don't need a weakling like you now go.","No necesitamos a una debilucha como tú. Ahora, lárgate.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh I am so-sorry but I think I can help.","Oh, lo siento. Pero creo que puedo ayudar.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey this is a private conversation!","¡Eh, esta es una conversación privada!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Sure, all at once, maybe you are an idiot.","Claro, todo de golpe. Puede que seas idiota.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Do not tell me by my name now I am the great captain, but is it true, will they have fallen asleep at the changing of the guard?","No me llames por mi nombre. Ahora soy la gran capitana. Pero dime, ¿es verdad? ¿Se habrán quedado dormidas durante el cambio de guardia?");
 ds_map_add(m,"See Tamara! There is not a single damn guard in this sector other than the one in the night club.","¡Mira, Tamara! No hay ni un solo maldito guardia en este sector, salvo el del club nocturno.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I will be waiting for you next to the abandoned house, do not be late Line if not, I will continue without you.","Te esperaré junto a la casa abandonada. No llegues tarde, Line; si no, continuaré sin ti.");
 ds_map_add(m,"..... go do the mission Alura.","... Ve a cumplir la misión, Alura.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Yeah easy, don't worry Tamara.","Sí, facilísimo. No te preocupes, Tamara.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Find out what makes the guards leave their posts and fix it.","Averigua por qué los guardias abandonan sus puestos y soluciona el problema.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I trust that they leave their position again because the house has no value.","Confío en que vuelvan a abandonar sus puestos, porque la casa no tiene ningún valor.");
 ds_map_add(m,"They are in the forest south of here I ordered them to take care of an abandoned house.","Están en el bosque al sur de aquí. Les ordené que vigilaran una casa abandonada.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well this is the mission the idea is that, go and spy on two guards who previously left their position.","Bueno, esta es la misión: ve a espiar a dos guardias que ya abandonaron sus puestos anteriormente.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thanks Lili","Gracias, Lili.");
 ds_map_add(m,"At least it's something.","Al menos es algo.");
 ds_map_add(m,"No, Lili is right, help me with this and I will tell all the guards about your lost friend so if someone see her I will be inform.","No, Lili tiene razón. Ayúdame con esto y avisaré a todos los guardias de que buscas a tu amiga desaparecida. Si alguien la ve, me enteraré.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili calm down it's not a big deal.","Lili, cálmate. No es para tanto.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey wait! How do yo pay her and we do it for free?","¡Eh, espera! ¿Por qué le pagas a ella y nosotras tenemos que hacerlo gratis?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ehh .. of course I will help.","Eh... por supuesto que ayudaré.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Geez Tamarara I am a mercenary let me be.","¡Por Dios, Tamara! Soy mercenaria, déjame en paz.");
 ds_map_add(m,"But I need someone to accompany her since she is some what explosive.","Pero necesito que alguien la acompañe, porque tiene un carácter bastante explosivo.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I Hire Alura to help me solve this problem.","Contraté a Alura para que me ayudara a resolver este problema.");
 ds_map_add(m,"We have a problem it seems that the guards leave their positions in the day.","Tenemos un problema: parece que los guardias abandonan sus puestos durante el día.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Something happens great captain?","¿Pasa algo, gran capitana?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey Line!.","¡Eh, Line!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line I will be waiting for you next to the abandoned house do not be late Line if I will not have to continue without you.","Line, te esperaré junto a la casa abandonada. No llegues tarde o tendré que continuar sin ti.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Spy on them and find out what is the reason the guards leave their posts on the day.","Espíalos y averigua por qué los guardias abandonan sus puestos durante el día.");
 ds_map_add(m,"I left two guards who previously left their position guarding an abandoned house south of here I trust that they will leave their position again.","Dejé a dos guardias que ya habían abandonado sus puestos vigilando una casa abandonada al sur de aquí. Confío en que vuelvan a abandonar sus puestos.");
 ds_map_add(m,"But it is somewhat explosive if you go with her and help her control herself it would help me a lot.","Pero es bastante explosiva. Si vas con ella y la ayudas a controlarse, me harías un gran favor.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Well this is what happens, for some reason the guards are leaving their possition on the day,I hire alura to take care of the problem.","Bueno, esto es lo que pasa: por alguna razón, los guardias abandonan sus puestos durante el día. He contratado a Alura para que se ocupe del problema.");
 ds_map_add(m,"And Lili stops being a complete lunatic.","Y Lili, deja de comportarte como una completa lunática.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ok both of you stop, Alura you do have messy hair.","Vale, parad las dos. Alura, sí que tienes el pelo desordenado.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Although you will have to put a muzzle on your fairy.","Aunque tendrás que ponerle un bozal a tu hada.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thanks I will do my best","Gracias. Haré todo lo posible.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Look if you want to help, it's okay, I recognize that you are strong.","Mira, si quieres ayudar, no hay problema. Reconozco que eres fuerte.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Ok Whatever.","Vale, lo que sea.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Lili stop being so angry!","¡Lili, deja de enfadarte tanto!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Oh your Liying bitch!","¡Oh, tú, zorra mentirosa!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Whatever, I held back in battle","Como quieras. Me contuve durante el combate.");
 ds_map_add(m,"You see we are strong!","¡¿Lo ves?! ¡Somos fuertes!");
 ds_map_add(m,"We have a problem it seems that the guards are leaving their possision in the day","Tenemos un problema: parece que los guardias están abandonando sus puestos durante el día.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Tamara told me that you are a great warrior and that you have helped many on this island if you want to help, I will tell you what happens.","Tamara me dijo que eres una gran guerrera y que has ayudado a mucha gente de esta isla. Si quieres ayudar, te contaré lo que está pasando.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hey there is no need to fight now.","Eh, no hace falta que nos peleemos ahora.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Prove it bitch!","¡Demuéstralo, zorra!");
 ds_map_add(m,"We are not weaklings and we have helped more people than you could in your life!","¡No somos unas debiluchas y hemos ayudado a más gente de la que tú podrías ayudar en toda tu vida!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Line go put your damn armor on!","¡Line, ve a ponerte esa maldita armadura!");
 ds_map_add(m,"Come in and if the great captain asks where you were, tell her that you only left the possision for a while to rest.","Entra. Y si la gran capitana pregunta dónde estabas, dile que solo abandonaste tu puesto un rato para descansar.");
 ds_map_add(m,"The two idiots that are guarding the abandoned house invite us.","Los dos idiotas que vigilan la casa abandonada nos han invitado.");
 ds_map_add(m,"*Face palm*","*Se lleva la mano a la cara*");
 ds_map_add(m,"Hi how do you do, fellow guard.","Hola, ¿qué tal, compañero guardia?");
 ds_map_add(m,"This Slime must be defeated now!","¡Hay que derrotar a este slime ahora mismo!");
 ds_map_add(m,"It was already inside, I managed to get it out, but it wants to get back in.","Ya estaba dentro. Conseguí sacarlo, pero quiere volver a entrar.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Is very close to the hospital, where did it come from?","Está muy cerca del hospital. ¿De dónde ha salido?");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thank you very much for your help.","Muchísimas gracias por tu ayuda.");
