 ds_map_add(m,"No thanks to you, I was on the verge of cutting off the penis of the one in the position of the helicopter.","Y no gracias a ti. Estaba a punto de cortarle la polla al que estaba haciendo la postura del helicóptero.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Thank you so much.","Muchísimas gracias.");
 ds_map_add(m,"You can have as a reward the armor is better than the few arcs that Tamara would give you.","Puedes quedarte con la armadura como recompensa. Vale mucho más que los pocos Arcs que Tamara te daría.");
 ds_map_add(m,"Whatever, it was a thing of the past I will report the mission as accomplished.","Como quieras. Eso ya es cosa del pasado. Informaré de que la misión se ha completado.");
